              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Insight 1",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": ": Inventory Management is Sub-Optimal",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The low ITR of 2.0 and the high volume of year-old stock indicate that JustDrinks is carrying excessive inventory, leading to high holding costs and poor capital utilization. The current inventory strategy is not aligned with the sales velocity of the products.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Insight 2",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": ": Profit Leakage in the Dominant Category",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "While Spirits drive the majority of revenue, the overall 30% Gross Profit Margin suggests that the company is not maximizing profitability on its most popular products. A lack of granular profit analysis (e.g., by SKU) is masking potential profit leakage.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Insight 3:",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " High Seasonal Risk in Procurement",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The current purchasing pattern, characterized by a massive spike in December, exposes the company to significant risk of stock-outs during the critical November/December holiday selling season. This late purchasing strategy is inefficient and potentially costly.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Insight 4",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": ": Blind Spots in Store Performance",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The technical error in the data model, which aggregates all store data to a single value, means management is currently operating without the ability to identify and replicate the best practices of high-performing stores or address the issues in underperforming locations.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
